    (uuid "dfa8da69-5933-54c3-a4aa-e1c8589fb8e9"))
  (text "SPI2 mode 3, <=2MHz. Set SCLK high before selecting; CS setup/read hold/release guard >=1us.\nU37 disconnects sensor clock, MOSI and MISO while CS_PAW is high; reset channel is always enabled.\nR72 holds CS high and R79 holds OPT_CTRL low at boot. Keep all CS high during reset and rail transitions.\nSensor MISO/MOTION are undefined in reset. Mask motion interrupt until initialization passes."
    (at 20 233 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.1 1.1))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "1b50b4db-dab0-563a-848e-ec236c3db2c1"))
  (text "OPT_CTRL low asserts reset despite the internal pull-up (600uA max). U39 isolates CS when unpowered.\nAfter valid rails: reset, wait >=50ms, clear motion registers, load authorized SROM and verify identity.\nSuspend: send Shutdown, deselect, assert reset, clear SENS_REQ. Resume requires full initialization/SROM."
    (at 20 260 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.1 1.1))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "e52e7429-9740-51cc-9307-c5c2e5131e3a"))
  (embedded_fonts no))
